{"id":"sbsiglist.1","n":"sbsiglist","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"sbsigntool","ver":"0.9.4-2ubuntu2","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/s/sbsigntool/sbsigntool_0.9.4-2ubuntu2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/sbsiglist.1.gz","sha256":"2ce0efe5a6bfc069e7e412d077cf6feebd2f1b2a486cd53d91a93917a0c6aecd","date":"November 2021","origin":"sbsiglist 0.9.4"}},"nopt":{"u":3},"desc":"Create EFI_SIGNATURE_LIST signature databases","u":[["NAME","<p>sbsiglist - Create EFI_SIGNATURE_LIST signature databases</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>sbsiglist</b> [<i>options</i>] <i>--owner &lt;guid&gt; --type &lt;type&gt; &lt;sig-file&gt;</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Create an EFI_SIGNATURE_LIST from a signature file Options:</p> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--owner</b> &lt;guid&gt;</dt><dd>Signature owner GUID</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--type</b> &lt;type&gt;</dt><dd>Signature type. One of: x509 sha256</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--output</b> &lt;file&gt;</dt><dd>write signed data to &lt;file&gt; (default &lt;sig-file&gt;.siglist)</dd></dl>"]]}